#: lib/pepe_web/live/agents_live.ex:502
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each slot lets one plugin replace a part of the agent. Default uses the project's choice."
msgstr ""
"Cada slot permite que un plugin reemplace una parte del agente. "
